    "null_no_false_positive": true,
    "key_finding": "On real INPOP19a residuals, a static Nordtvedt injection (\u03b7=-3.91e-04) is absorbed at 97.1% efficiency by an 82-parameter ephemeris-like basis. A dynamically modulated TEP injection of the same amplitude leaves sidebands surviving at 96.0% after identical fitting. The null case shows no spurious carrier extraction. This controlled-injection test confirms that spectral orthogonality of cross-frequency sidebands\u2014not merely parameter-count inadequacy\u2014prevents standard ephemeris-like fitting from absorbing the TEP signal."
